# Reproduction of Turner Fig. 3 ("Message flow during a reconfiguration"):
# leader l prepares ballot b on a1, then proposes to a2 through era e; the
# reconfiguration crosses into era e + 1 with ballot b' and the proposals
# continue under the new configuration. `numbers off` matches his furniture
# (his figures carry no message numbers); empty labels match his unlabeled
# reply vectors.
actors a1=a₁ l=ℓ a2=a₂
numbers off
era e
1 l->a1: prepare(b)
2 a1->l:
3 l->a2: proposed_i(b)
4 a2->l:
5 l->a2: proposed_{i+1}(b)
6 a2->l:
7 l->a2: proposed_{i+2}(b)
8 a2->l:
9 l->a2: proposed_{i+3}(b)
10 a2->l:
11 l->a2: proposed_{i+4}(b)
12 a2->l:
13 l->a2: proposed_{i+5}(b)
14 a2->l:
era e + 1
15 l->a1: prepare(b')
16 a1->l:
17 l->a2: proposed_{i+6}(b)
18 a2->l:
19 l->a2: proposed_{i+7}(b)
20 a2->l:
21 l->a2: proposed_{i+8}(b)
22 a2->l:
23 l->a2: proposed_{i+9}(b)
24 a2->l:
25 l->a2: proposed_{i+10}(b)
26 a2->l:
27 l->a2: proposed_{i+11}(b)
28 a2->l:
29 l->a2: proposed_{i+12}(b')
30 a2->l:
31 l->a2: proposed_{i+13}(b')
